    "sub_ename": "MORTGAGE AND URBAN LAND CONSOLIDATION VALUATION PRACTICE TRAINING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程訓練不動產擔保品估價、市地重劃估價等不動產估價專業技能與分析解釋能力，以配合金融機構抵押權設定及都市計畫土地開發之執行。",
    "describe_eh": "This course trains valuation professional skills and interpretation capabilities,  including real estate collateral and urban land consolidation valuation to coordinate with the establishment of mortgage rights of financial institutions and the execution of urban planned land development.",
